      "t": "Вот видишь? И никакой аллергии.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "And that's the scene: a broken lock, a stolen feast, and a boy who has just eaten the one thing he was told never to touch. We'll soon find out what the caviar does. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
